-- S14: PST Forecasting — Predict pattern completion before it happens
-- EventFlux: NO CAPABILITY
--
-- Varpulis uses Prediction Suffix Trees (PST) to predict the probability
-- that a partially-matched pattern will complete, BEFORE the final event
-- arrives. This enables proactive alerting (e.g., "80% chance this fraud
-- pattern will complete in the next 2 minutes").
--
-- Performance: 51 nanoseconds per single-symbol prediction
--              105 nanoseconds per full distribution prediction
--
-- No other CEP engine in the market offers this capability.
--
-- CANNOT RUN IN EVENTFLUX
